"""Simulation of a delta-debug on a metamodel (json file written by verrou_dd_metamodel).
The algorithms of DD_stoch (pyTools of this source tree) are used unchanged : only the samples are
simulated (failure drawn with the failure probability of the metamodel, duration given by its time model)
and the thread pool is replaced by a virtual time executor, so the simulated wall time takes into account
--num-threads= and the early exits. The cache is written as usual (dd.fake by default) and the
trace of --trace-file= uses the simulated time (readable by verrou_dd_trace_convert)."""

